Package: iadhoreR
Type: Package
Title: R Interface to i-ADHoRe for Detecting Genomic Collinearity
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Zhen", "Li",
      email = "zhen.li@psb.vib-ugent.be",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides an R interface to the i-ADHoRe 3.0 software for
    detecting collinear regions and multiplicons in genomic data. Includes
    helper functions for preparing input files (gene lists from GFF/GTF,
    BLAST/DIAMOND homolog tables, MCL gene family clustering) and parsing
    all i-ADHoRe output tables into R data frames. Requires i-ADHoRe,
    DIAMOND, and MCL to be installed and available on the PATH
    (e.g. via conda: conda install -c bioconda i-adhore diamond mcl).
